            <label>Search Term Provided</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>PPIA Agentforce Action 1 — Resolves a Purchaser Plan by name search. Returns plan ID, status, current PPIA composite score, star rating, and rating label. Always call this FIRST when a user asks about any insurance plan.</description>
    <label>PPIA Resolve Plan</label>
